  "description": "Are you ready to explore? Get lost and find unmissable views, enjoy sunsets and early morning mists. The Bivio Gravel is an adventure gravel frame for bike-packing, touring, exploring and gravel riding. Constructed from world-renowned Columbus Spirit triple-butted steel tubing, the Bivio Gravel delivers the distinct, smooth ride of steel that is a joy all day and over anything.The frame features multiple mounting options across the top tube and forks for more carrying capacity, whether it be for hydration or bike-packing bags. The gravel geometry is based around our race geometry, tweaked for added stability. Cover great distances on rough terrain with a smile as you whizz down mountain passes, through canyons, or simply wave to patrons on a canal towpath.",
